    "first_comment": "Thank you. Need those reminders. LEARNING. Healing. Rebuilding.\n\nI’m currently in my Goddess Glow-Up Era after surviving 20 years of DV, chaos and fear. Right now, I’m embracing what I jokingly call my “Gypsy Era” (the fancy way of saying homeless) while I rebuild my life from the ground up after losing almost everything through the court process.\n\nIt’s not where I expected to be, but it’s where I’m meant to grow. One step at a time, one lesson at a time, one fierce comeback at a time. ✨",
